// Build settings the app target always has. Referenced from `project.yml`, so it
// survives `xcodegen generate` — a setting typed into Xcode's UI does not.

// ⚠️ **Nothing in this file may give the routing key a way into the app** (ADR
// 2026-09-12). It used to default the key's build setting to empty and then
// optionally include a gitignored secrets xcconfig, which put a real key into
// `Info.plist`, into every build log, and into the query string of every request
// to the Worker, on any machine that had the file. The config flip (ADR
// 2026-09-08) made the key unnecessary; removing the path made it unreachable.
// The Worker holds the key. `Scripts/check-secrets.sh` and `RoutingKeyTests` fail
// if either line comes back.
